          "filename": "Jonas Haas - Prospect af det Kongl. Slott Hirschholm taget fra Hoved-indgangen.png",
          "caption": "Haas made the engraving for Erik Pontoppidan's Danske Atlas, where it appeared in Volume II at page 240. The present print is a hand coloured version with additional text in three languages. It was based on a watercolour by Johan Jacob Bruun, turned into an etching by Michael Keyl in the 1749 book Den Danske Vitruvius, volume II. Haas simply copied it.",
